  "reason": "The only completed run is a simple RNA-only single-profile PCA baseline (accuracy 0.485, F1 0.464), so there is no evidence yet about whether image features are predictive. config_010 tests an image-only single-profile ResNet50 baseline while keeping the profile setting simple and avoiding aggregation or fusion. This establishes the second unimodal baseline, reduces uncertainty about the modality decision, and will guide whether to invest in image or multimodal configurations rather than assuming fusion will help."
